 game - it's a virtual driving experience that will leave you breathless. Step into the driver's seat, grab the steering, and experience the Virtual Steering with  true 360\u00b0+ control with dual-hand precision. Whether you prefer manual or automatic transmission, Metadrive offers a hybrid driving experience like no other. ", "short_description": "Take the wheel and experience the rush of high-speed VR racing like no other. With precision virtual steering, you'll feel the power as you conquer every curve and straightaway."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maddytroupe.github.io/games-github.io/tspp2.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Maddy Troupe", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://maddytroupe.github.io/games-github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "30473542718927267"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821200_953365873497517_1165853181189702478_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fl8FoxYCyNkQ7kNvwGPmxWj&_nc_oc=AdqYv4JVAxvdwF4gO44s4Pw2Mk90kbTe4mOryzPYBC9Gs-f04j8d1zw7bnMRLRFZirI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHwS_0W0_0zD4RA0c0LsEB92Q2OClLdWZUDxMfqGsN2g&oe=6